<%# page title: PreCheckd Demo %>
<div class="legal-page">
  <h1 class="page-title">Try PreCheckd</h1>
  <p class="updated-date">A live demo with sample data. Nothing here is real, and nothing you do is saved.</p>

  <div class="content-card">
    <h2>See it as a recruiter</h2>
    <p>Search verified candidates, look at their tested skill levels, send a connection request and ask for full access. In the demo, requests are approved on the spot so you can see what comes next.</p>
    <form method="post" action="/demo/recruiter"><button type="submit" class="btn btn-large btn-primary">Try the recruiter demo</button></form>

    <h2>See it as a candidate</h2>
    <p>Browse open jobs the way a verified candidate does and see how a job posting reads.</p>
    <form method="post" action="/demo/candidate"><button type="submit" class="btn btn-large btn-secondary">Try the candidate demo</button></form>
  </div>

  <div class="content-card" style="text-align:center;">
    <h2>Ready for the real thing?</h2>
    <p>Founding spots are limited, and the founding price is locked in for as long as you stay.</p>
    <p><a href="<%= signupUrl %>" class="btn btn-large btn-primary">Start your founding spot</a></p>
    <p>Looking for work? <a href="<%= candidateSignupUrl %>">Get verified as a candidate</a>.</p>
  </div>
</div>
